PyPWDFT third-party notices
===========================

GTH pseudopotential parameter files (pade/ and pbe/)
----------------------------------------------------
The parameter files in pade/ and pbe/ were copied unchanged from the eminus
3.2.2 distribution (https://github.com/wangenau/eminus). eminus records that
they are identical to the files in the CP2K data repository,
https://github.com/cp2k/cp2k-data, and describes CP2K as licensed under the
GNU General Public License, version 2. The cp2k-data repository distributes
the GPL version 2 license text and does not state whether "or any later
version" applies to the data files.

Please cite the original publications when using these parameters:

  S. Goedecker, M. Teter, and J. Hutter, Phys. Rev. B 54, 1703 (1996),
  https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.54.1703.
  C. Hartwigsen, S. Goedecker, and J. Hutter, Phys. Rev. B 58, 3641 (1998),
  https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.58.3641.
  M. Krack, Theor. Chem. Acc. 114, 145 (2005),
  https://doi.org/10.1007/s00214-005-0655-y.

